```yaml
{{ include "matrix.guard" . }}
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: {{ .Release.Name }}
  namespace: {{ .Release.Namespace }}
spec:
{{ if .Values.maintenance }}
  replicas: 0
{{ else if not .Values.autoscaling.enabled }}
  replicas: {{ .Values.replicas }}
{{ end }}
  selector:
    matchLabels: {app: {{ .Release.Name | quote }}}
  template:
    metadata:
      labels: {app: {{ .Release.Name | quote }}}
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: app
        image: registry.invalid/stateful-app:1
        resources:
          requests: {cpu: "100m"}
          limits: {cpu: "500m"}
        volumeMounts: [{name: data, mountPath: /data}]
      volumes:
      - name: data
{{ if eq .Values.storage.mode "existing" }}
        persistentVolumeClaim:
          claimName: {{ .Values.storage.claim | quote }}
{{ else }}
        emptyDir: {}
{{ end }}
{{ if and (not .Values.maintenance) .Values.autoscaling.enabled }}
---
apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
metadata:
  name: {{ .Release.Name }}
  namespace: {{ .Release.Namespace }}
spec:
  scaleTargetRef: {apiVersion: apps/v1, kind: Deployment, name: {{ .Release.Name | quote }}}
  minReplicas: {{ .Values.autoscaling.min }}
  maxReplicas: {{ .Values.autoscaling.max }}
  metrics:
  - type: Resource
    resource:
      name: cpu
      target: {type: Utilization, averageUtilization: 60}
{{ end }}
{{ if not .Values.maintenance }}
---
apiVersion: policy/v1
kind: PodDisruptionBudget
metadata:
  name: {{ .Release.Name }}
  namespace: {{ .Release.Namespace }}
spec:
  minAvailable: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels: {app: {{ .Release.Name | quote }}}
{{ end }}
```

实现组合合同而非分别维护多份环境清单：正常固定模式Deployment设置replicas；正常自动伸缩模式省略Deployment.replicas，由HPA(min/max、CPU60%目标)管理；维护模式强制副本0且无HPA/PDB。正常模式PDB minAvailable=1。storage.ephemeral使用emptyDir，existing只引用给定claim，不创建PVC；项目为避免同卷跨节点挂载风险，约定声明ReadWriteOnce时正常模式最大副本不得大于1（这是本项目保守策略，不是Kubernetes说RWO只能一个Pod）；ReadWriteMany不受此策略限制。始终验证min<=max，固定schema保持不变。CPU request100m/limit500m、卷名与挂载、HPA目标与PDB selector要一致。验收组合矩阵，不验证已有PVC真实accessMode、存储可用性、metrics-server或运行时扩缩容。

## 原理与原题解答
建立有限受支持配置档案及类型schema，关键差异用正交参数表达，拒绝不受支持组合。测试覆盖关键交互和每个生产档案，记录渲染摘要；不能无限增加布尔开关却没有对应兼容责任。

