{{- define "capacity.count" -}}
{{- if kindIs "string" .value -}}
  {{- $percent := trimSuffix "%" .value | int -}}
  {{- $product := mul .replicas $percent -}}
  {{- if .roundUp -}}{{ div (add $product 99) 100 }}{{- else -}}{{ div $product 100 }}{{- end -}}
{{- else -}}
  {{- .value -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- define "capacity.guard" -}}
{{- $surge := include "capacity.count" (dict "value" .Values.maxSurge "replicas" .Values.replicas "roundUp" true) | int -}}
{{- $unavailable := include "capacity.count" (dict "value" .Values.maxUnavailable "replicas" .Values.replicas "roundUp" false) | int -}}
{{- if and (eq $surge 0) (eq $unavailable 0) -}}{{ fail "rolling progress would be blocked" }}{{- end -}}
{{- if gt $unavailable (int .Values.replicas) -}}{{ fail "unavailable exceeds replica policy" }}{{- end -}}
{{- $peak := add .Values.replicas $surge -}}
{{- if gt (mul $peak .Values.cpuMilli) (int64 .Values.budgetCPU) -}}{{ fail "CPU request budget exceeded" }}{{- end -}}
{{- if gt (mul $peak .Values.memoryMi) (int64 .Values.budgetMemory) -}}{{ fail "memory request budget exceeded" }}{{- end -}}
{{- end -}}
```

补完整 capacity.guard 与其计算 helper，固定 Deployment 与 schema 不变。maxSurge 百分比向上取整、maxUnavailable 百分比向下取整；整数直接使用。拒绝两者取整后同时为 0，以及 unavailable 超过 replicas 的训练发布策略。峰值 Pod 数按 replicas+surge，CPU/memory requests 乘峰值后不得超过给定预算。允许恰好等于预算，不得降低副本或改资源请求来绕过门禁。验收覆盖整数/百分比、边界取整、CPU/内存分别超限和 schema 错误输入。此预算模型不含终止宽限期额外 Pod、DaemonSet、其他业务与实际节点调度；不声称集群容量已验证。

